---
import { profile } from '../data/profile';
---
<section id="dev-about" class="container section about">
  <div>
    <h2 class="section__title">About</h2>
    <p>I build web apps, mostly TypeScript and Node. Most recently I shipped
      features for two production SaaS platforms: an AI text-messaging product
      that books appointments out of lead conversations, and an automated
      payments and commissions platform. The work ran from onboarding flows and
      Twilio compliance through time-zone-correct scheduling and reconciling
      payment data across a version migration.</p>
    <p>Before I wrote software full time, I spent 2020 to 2024 at GoDaddy
      helping hundreds of businesses get their websites live, and before that I
      designed escape rooms and ran a 20-person team. Same lesson both times:
      the build only counts if the person on the other side can actually use it.</p>
    <p>Based in Minneapolis, open to remote, and looking for my next role.</p>
  </div>
  {profile.photos.dev && (
    <img src={profile.photos.dev} width="180" height="180" alt="Eric Hung" class="about__shot" />
  )}
</section>
